Dear players,

In this patch we made some balancing adjustments, and fixed some bugs as well. See below for the details

Buffed the firepower of Reimu, Marisa and Keine
Nerfed the firepower of Moukou
Adjusted Bomb performance for all heroines except Yuyuko;
Adjusted items drop from some enemies in Stage 1 ,3, 4;
Adjusted the configuration of some enemies in Stage 2, 3, 4;
Adjusted the HP of some enemies in Stage 4, 5, 6;
Disabled the hitbox of Lily White before her first attack;
Adjusted the difficulty of Spell Card 2 of Inori in Stage 5;
Reduced the hitbox size of the sakura bullets in Spell Card 4 of Inori in Stage 5;
Changed the design of Spell Card 1 of Shizuka in Stage 6;
Fixed some bullets texture & hitbox bugs;
Optimized the game menu function;
Attention: All the replays saved before 1.03 version will be no longer compatible after the update. However we provide the possiblity to watch the old replays. If you want to revert 1.02 version, please follow these steps:
Right click on the game icon-properties->BETAS->Select the beta you would like to opt into->1.02version
After this update, we expect no more changes unless fixing serious bugs。

We have planned German and French version. We appreciate it if you are willing to help with the translation. You are also welcome if you wish to add support for your language.

Thanks for your support. We love you all.

Greetings,
Your developer team
